<title>USA: Clear Creek ISD, Texas won by William Hough.</title>
<headline>Clear Creek ISD, Texas won by William Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Hough said it won $36.855 million of Clear Creek Ind Sch Dist, Texas, schoolhouse Series 1997 bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.400 percent.</p>
</text>
